    "body": "If I were to see that script, I'd probably think the repetition was a typo, if I'm honest.\r\n \r\nI don't know that we should set the precedent making our init script support fish. It would probably lead to us making similar changes to scripts in our docs.\r\nMost users of fish are aware that they need to run bash scripts with either [bass](https://github.com/edc/bass) or a bourne-compatible shell.",
