    "body": "My vote is to leave this as is: we also support xonsh, nu, ion, and powershell--it's highly unlikely that we'll find syntax that works for all of them.\r\n\r\nI think the correct way to handle this is to create a setup page as has been discussed on the v2 page, with multiple collapsible sections per-shell.",
